  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 40 Marginalized Youth Access Higher Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With your help, BEAM Education Foundations will financially support 40 marginalized Myanmar youth to take the international high school equivalency examination (GED) and attend college. BEAM provides academic knowledge and fosters youth participation at the community level within the Thai-Myanmar border area and inside Myanmar. Students need support with the GED exams fees to certify their education level. The GED exam is made up of 4 subjects and a previous &quot;Ready Test&quot; for each subject.</narrative>
  </description>
